From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:02:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1044/1044] SableOS: Browser start page, command dock, reader
 mode, tab grid and site prompts

BROWSER_WEBVIEW_UX states 1-4 on Jelly:

* Start page (BROWSER_START_SEARCH): a tab with no page shows Start /
  Search with Bookmarks, Private tab, History and Downloads cards and
  the keys card ("Alt+L address/search, / find, Tab focus"; single
  keys are off while typing). New tabs open it: the home page
  autoload default is now off (the setting still works).
* Command dock: under the page (above the bar in reach mode), a
  "> browser command..." line that focuses the address bar and a hint
  line for the start page, a page, or reader mode with its block
  position ("Reader 2/8"). Hidden for fullscreen video and PWAs.
* Reader mode (R): rebuilds the page from its own headings,
  paragraphs, lists, quotes, code and images in one column with every
  attribute but href/src/alt dropped; R again reloads the page. Needs
  the JavaScript setting; nothing is fetched or sent.
* Link mode (L / Shift+L): focuses the next / previous visible link
  with a visible outline; Enter opens it.
* Tabs: Alt+W closes this tab, Alt+K / Alt+J (Ctrl+Tab) switch tabs,
  Alt+A opens a two-column tab grid (current tab focused; Enter
  switches; D, Del or Alt+W closes). Tabs are this app's document
  tasks (ActivityManager.getAppTasks), nothing new is stored.
* Private tabs: Recents, the lock screen and the grid show "Private
  tab" without page title or icon, and Recents takes no screenshot.
* Site prompts (WEBVIEW_PERMISSION): camera and microphone now ask
  per site (origin shown) before the Android permission, even when the
  app already holds it; a request nothing was granted for is denied
  instead of left open. Deny, Block or Dismiss has keyboard focus in
  the camera/microphone, location, protected media and download
  dialogs, so Enter never allows by default.
